<title>USA: Piazztec names Edwin Phelps president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Piazztec names Edwin Phelps president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGEPORT, Conn. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piazztec International Inc said Thursday it named Edwin F. Phelps Jr. as president and chief executive director.</p>
<p>Phelps, who is a director of the company, replaces Edward Cowle, who will remain a director, the company said.  Cowle is also a major shareholder, it added.</p>
